            },
            "native_start": 1139,
            "native_end": 1639,
            "text": "(1)    This code applies to all general, primary, congressional vacancy, school district, special \ndistrict, ballot issue, and other authorized elections unless otherwise provided by this code. This \ncode applies to any municipal election conducted as part of a coordinated election except to the \nextent that this code conflicts with a specific charter provision. Any municipality may provide by \nordinance or resolution that it will utilize the requirements and procedures of this code in lieu of \n",
            "text_sha256": "58983efa06e6ca737228fcad32088468225b712150c4d68285b7db9de8f467af",
