        "text": "Source: L. 92: Entire article R&RE, p. 624, § 1, effective January 1, 1993. L. 93: Entire \nsection amended, p. 1393, § 1, effective July 1. L. 94: (2) amended, p. 1149, § 1, effective July 1. \n \n",
